#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.4.rst:4
msgid "v4.1.4"
msgstr "v4.1.4"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.4.rst:6
msgid ""
"v4.1.4 is a maintenance release that updates the bundled MicroPython "
"submodule. It introduces **no breaking API changes** — v4.1.3 scripts run "
"unchanged."
msgstr ""
"v4.1.4 adalah rilis pemeliharaan yang memperbarui submodul MicroPython yang "
"dibundel. Versi ini **tidak memperkenalkan perubahan API yang memutus "
"kompatibilitas** — skrip v4.1.3 berjalan tanpa perubahan."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.4.rst:13
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "On this page"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.4.rst:16
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Highlights"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.4.rst:18
msgid "**MicroPython submodule updated.**"
msgstr "**Submodul MicroPython diperbarui.**"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.4.rst:19
msgid ""
"**No breaking API changes** — reflash and your v4.1.3 scripts run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"**Tidak ada perubahan API yang memutus kompatibilitas** — flash ulang dan "
"skrip v4.1.3 Anda berjalan tanpa perubahan."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.4.rst:23
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Other changes and improvements"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.4.rst:25
msgid ""
"The bundled MicroPython submodule was updated (upstream fixes and "
"improvements)."
msgstr ""
"Submodul MicroPython yang dibundel diperbarui (perbaikan dan peningkatan "
"upstream)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.4.rst:29
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "Breaking API changes"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.1.4.rst:31
msgid ""
"v4.1.4 introduces **no breaking Python API changes**. Scripts that ran on "
"v4.1.3 run unchanged on v4.1.4 — just reflash the firmware."
msgstr ""
"v4.1.4 **tidak memperkenalkan perubahan API Python yang memutus "
"kompatibilitas**\\ . Skrip yang berjalan pada v4.1.3 berjalan tanpa "
"perubahan pada v4.1.4 — cukup flash ulang firmware."
